{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字裕之，\n金、秀容人，金亡不仕，號遺山真隱，有遺山集行於世。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西紀一三五七年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃潛，元，\n義烏人，字晉卿，延祐進士，生平博極羣書，議論精約，在朝挺然自立，不附權貴，時稱其清風，纖塵弗染，\n有《日損齋稿》及《筆記》行世。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當為顧之誤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雷希顏，名淵，一字季默，好讀書，與李之純游，任監察御史，彈劾不避權貴，大著威望，為金\n大理寺卿雷恩之子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安正忘筌論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有洪儒論道集崇正辯屏山有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堯舜禹湯曾子子思孟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷之一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虖，古乎字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "搥提仁義，出楊子法「言」，捨棄仁義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃帝虞舜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷之二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張九成字子韶號無垢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷之三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出言也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語在《南康軍開先禪院記》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷之四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上蔡——謝良佐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卷之五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "屏山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "霸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X87n1628_p0440b17"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《河南程氏遺書》（六安塗氏求我齋所刊書本第1卷第23b頁）"}
